<title>USA: PepsiCo Latam uncertainties spur trading.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo Latam uncertainties spur trading.</headline>
<byline>Gilles Castonguay</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo Inc's stock has traded actively this week amid uncertainties surrounding its bottling operations in Latin America, among other problems facing the food and beverage company, analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;People are getting in and getting out -- depending on how they want to play it out in the short-term,&quot; said one expert who spoke on condition of anonymity.</p>
